# Accepted, time-boxed vulnerability exceptions. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry;
# after the expiry date the CI scan fails again and the exception must be re-justified.

# libzstd1 (Debian 13), information disclosure in zstd decompression. Fixed in
# 1.5.7+dfsg-1+deb13u1, but python:3.13-slim and distroless/nodejs24-debian13 have not been
